    "ciesin:nasa_doi": "10.7927/H42Z13FP",
    "ciesin:sedac_doi": "10.7927/H42Z13FP",
    "ciesin:purpose": "To provide street intersection data for each county in the U.S.",
    "ciesin:supplemental_info": "These data can be used to provide: a nearest location (i.e. mortgage deed); point data that can be imported into a desktop GIS measure and copied to any geographic layer (e.g. census tract); and to calculate street density (number of street intersections per land area or unit).",
